{"title":"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Problem_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/4/5d47f9a02b42ced16835cba756dabba881c5cb28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{A}\\text{B}\\Gamma\\Delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" /> be a parallelogram. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/f/98f503c78778504322eab8764238ffabd7ae0b2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\epsilon)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" /> be a straight line passing through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/4/7c43070a2acf8f4e25d98e48c404d9348a26d40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> without cutting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/4/5d47f9a02b42ced16835cba756dabba881c5cb28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{A}\\text{B}\\Gamma\\Delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/c/56c719f18eb4373c7a458afbde59739161481fb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{B} &#39;, \\Gamma &#39;, \\Delta &#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"67\" height=\"17\" /> are the projections of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/3/253cea898ede31488f93237495a059b64795745f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{B}, \\Gamma, \\Delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/f/98f503c78778504322eab8764238ffabd7ae0b2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\epsilon)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" /> respectively, show that\n</p><p>a) the distance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/f/98f503c78778504322eab8764238ffabd7ae0b2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\epsilon)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" /> is equal to the sum of the distances <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/9/09920c3af0daa12ac2ec5174e737c31e0f8cec75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{B}$\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a737670d481129e2ead6d7223437f3cf70ea53f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/f/98f503c78778504322eab8764238ffabd7ae0b2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\epsilon)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/8/b4892e433f2f924bed9ecc2921e81430e09a2d02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Area}(\\text{B}\\Gamma\\Delta)=\\text{Area}(\\text{B} &#39;\\Gamma &#39;\\Delta &#39;)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"211\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_1\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 1\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/b/83bd427028ea55d478361eafd719d96ed49a0288.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha=\\sin x_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/6/df60bb174686e502144e5dcea2ef53d252a83bc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta=\\cos x_{1}\\sin x_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"125\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/8/448e64dfa16f44c4c65c3c625b2333919abd15dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma=\\cos x_{1}\\cos x_{2} \\sin x_{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"173\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/8/4b87f083409f2ea0165e98c49730f863d5fe55d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\delta=\\cos x_{1}\\cos x_{2}\\cos x_{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"173\" height=\"15\" /> prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/1/791ffc7eef9b76c9cbe83346ab0fb909d5926e52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2+\\beta^2+\\gamma^2+\\delta^2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_2\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 2\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prove that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/e/d3ef0ac1c543f345ae79821f1c640f715acb11b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\kappa, \\lambda, \\nu$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> are positive integers, then the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/169028f8970c2ad16ab457b006c4716a30b9c2b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-(\\nu +2)\\kappa\\lambda x+\\kappa^2\\lambda^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"218\" height=\"19\" /> has irrational roots.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_3\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 3\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/5/c350fcbae8eddc9e43c3beba8ed3da7933f9217c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_{1}, \\rho_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"11\" /> are the roots of equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/e/98e5f7614c160535ad235368ae863ead8f54b24e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-x+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" /> then:\n</p><p>a) Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/5/375b4d3af7b372f77c92b3bc71a588fbc2335dfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_{1}^3=\\rho_{2}^3 = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"19\" /> and\n</p><p>b) Calculate the value of: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff221bbfeb070e32cbfd8d764643e7da28bbf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_{1}^{2006} + \\rho_{2}^{2006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_4\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 4\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial\">Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_competition\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018110905\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 138/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4647/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4294:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018110905 and revision id 142694. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}